00:16:12,570 --> 00:16:15,230
It can only apply what the expert defined.

275
00:16:16,080 --> 00:16:19,910
And the fourth layer is the execution
layer, where the executor runs those

276
00:16:19,920 --> 00:16:25,330
SQL queries or the API calls across
sources, and we get the response back.

277
00:16:26,510 --> 00:16:27,090
Okay, cool.

