00:17:05,570 --> 00:17:07,390
We can help give some inputs to the LLM.

291
00:17:07,400 --> 00:17:12,270
So really a three-tier kind of
architecture bringing that all together.

292
00:17:13,670 --> 00:17:15,020
Yeah, exactly.

